# Groups - chrome (actions/chrome/chrome_groups.4.kbd)
**groups + spc**      -- Tabs Spc
**groups + l**        -- Tabs Next (C-tab)
**groups + h**        -- Tabs Prev (C-S-tab)
**groups + t**        -- Tabs New (C-t)
**groups + w**        -- Tabs Close (C-w)
**groups + lsft + t** -- Tabs Undo Close (C-S-t)
**groups + 1**        -- Tabs Goto 1 (C-1)
**groups + 2**        -- Tabs Goto 2 (C-2)
**groups + 3**        -- Tabs Goto 3 (C-3)
**groups + 4**        -- Tabs Goto 4 (C-4)
**groups + 5**        -- Tabs Goto 5 (C-5)
**groups + 6**        -- Tabs Goto 6 (C-6)
**groups + 7**        -- Tabs Goto 7 (C-7)
**groups + 8**        -- Tabs Goto 8 (C-8)
**groups + 9**        -- Tabs Goto 9 (C-9)
**groups + toggle**   -- Tabs Toggle (A-w)
